WEBVTT

01:29.460 --> 01:33.150
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.550 --> 01:36.060
[Episode 15]

01:38.720 --> 01:40.330
The outcome is decided.

01:40.560 --> 01:42.560
Blue Team made a mistake
in their dance

01:42.560 --> 01:44.820
and failed to complete the performance.

01:45.440 --> 01:46.720
This round

01:47.400 --> 01:49.000
goes to Red Team.

01:49.479 --> 01:50.560
Great!

01:50.560 --> 01:51.720
We won!

01:51.840 --> 01:53.000
We won!

02:01.960 --> 02:02.680
Next

02:02.930 --> 02:04.160
is the second round

02:04.160 --> 02:05.930
of the Hall of Elegance competition:

02:05.930 --> 02:07.180
Shi Qi.

02:07.640 --> 02:10.030
Each team captain will appoint one person

02:10.050 --> 02:11.650
to finish this game of chess.

02:11.960 --> 02:13.630
When playing,

02:13.760 --> 02:15.240
before placing a piece,

02:15.260 --> 02:18.460
you must state the corresponding number
and Chinese character

02:15.910 --> 02:16.890
[Home] [People] [Mountain]

02:16.980 --> 02:17.590
[Dynasty]

02:18.490 --> 02:20.410
for the intersection point

02:19.810 --> 02:20.730
[Star]

02:20.640 --> 02:23.320
based on the vertical
and horizontal lines on the board.

02:20.800 --> 02:21.640
[Star] [Wind] [Sky]

02:23.360 --> 02:24.550
[Star] [Wind] [Sky]

02:23.440 --> 02:26.160
A poem must be recited
before a piece is placed.

02:26.760 --> 02:29.820
Exceeding the time limit means a loss.

02:29.970 --> 02:32.840
Who can play such a complicated game?

02:32.860 --> 02:36.340
Didn't I say the captains would choose?

02:36.920 --> 02:38.520
Isn't that a death sentence
for whoever volunteers?

02:38.520 --> 02:39.810
Not necessarily.

02:40.130 --> 02:40.960
If you win,

02:41.600 --> 02:43.079
you won't have to die.

02:45.440 --> 02:46.960
Captain, don't pick me.

02:47.250 --> 02:48.530
I don't know how to play chess.

02:48.530 --> 02:49.590
I don't want to die.

02:51.340 --> 02:52.920
Not only do you have to play chess,

02:52.920 --> 02:54.650
you also have to recite poetry.

02:54.680 --> 02:55.610
This is too...

02:58.320 --> 02:59.280
How about...

03:04.560 --> 03:05.000
I'll do it.

03:05.000 --> 03:05.760
Nan Yanzhi.

03:05.780 --> 03:06.580
Yanzhi.

03:06.950 --> 03:08.510
I can't let you do it.

03:08.560 --> 03:09.200
Don't worry.

03:09.200 --> 03:10.510
It just so happens

03:10.960 --> 03:12.290
that I know a bit of both.

03:42.600 --> 03:44.240
How could you compete yourself?

03:44.240 --> 03:45.360
I said

03:45.620 --> 03:48.340
the captains choose the players,

03:49.190 --> 03:50.930
but I never said
they couldn't choose themselves.

03:50.930 --> 03:51.450
You...

03:53.000 --> 03:53.800
We're doomed.

03:53.800 --> 03:55.780
Now that President Wan steps
into the arena herself,

03:55.780 --> 03:57.840
isn't Yanzhi in grave danger?

03:59.329 --> 04:01.200
With voice-keeper stepping in personally,

04:01.200 --> 04:02.910
it's certain death.

04:03.020 --> 04:03.820
Is that so?

04:03.850 --> 04:05.280
I beg to differ.

04:05.340 --> 04:06.600
I'll wager a thousand taels

04:06.600 --> 04:07.400
Hmm.

04:07.660 --> 04:08.540
on her winning.

04:09.960 --> 04:11.470
I want to meet someone.

04:11.490 --> 04:12.450
I heard

04:12.800 --> 04:14.330
she is in your Lingya Tower.

04:14.560 --> 04:17.070
When the time comes,
I'll use my wager as a signal

04:17.070 --> 04:19.040
to tell you who I want to meet.

04:23.830 --> 04:26.130
The second round of the Hall of Elegance,

04:26.240 --> 04:27.080
Shi Qi,

04:27.960 --> 04:29.370
officially begins.

04:32.760 --> 04:35.120
White snow on the three rivers
returns to the green mound,

04:35.120 --> 04:37.800
the endless Yellow River
winds around black mountains.

04:35.470 --> 04:37.000
[Snow] [Flower]

04:37.000 --> 04:38.310
[Snow] [Three]

04:42.670 --> 04:44.300
[Snow] [Flower]

04:46.840 --> 04:48.440
Don't blame me for not reminding you.

04:48.440 --> 04:50.760
There is a time limit for making a move.

04:54.760 --> 04:57.960
A timeout will result in a loss.

04:57.530 --> 04:59.020
[Si hour] [Wu hour]

05:04.160 --> 05:06.010
Past glories of the Six Dynasties
fade with the river's flow,

05:06.010 --> 05:07.090
[Dynasty]

05:06.390 --> 05:08.470
leaving only cold mist and dying grass
in a stagnant green glow.

05:08.050 --> 05:09.430
[Six]

05:12.600 --> 05:13.960
Seven or eight stars glimmer
beyond the sky,

05:13.960 --> 05:16.410
two or three drops of rain fall
before the mountain.

05:16.410 --> 05:17.940
[Star]

05:18.400 --> 05:20.330
How can she make every move so fast?

05:27.440 --> 05:29.690
[Wu hour] [Wei hour]

05:33.840 --> 05:35.920
A cup of wine to go with a brand new song,

05:35.920 --> 05:38.920
The weather and pavilion
remain the same as last year.

05:39.400 --> 05:41.460
If Yanzhi takes this long every time,

05:41.560 --> 05:42.510
will she lose?

05:42.570 --> 05:44.240
She is definitely going to lose.

05:44.240 --> 05:45.800
President Wan designed this board.

05:45.800 --> 05:47.820
She knows every poem

05:48.010 --> 05:49.760
corresponding to each character by heart.

05:49.760 --> 05:52.190
How could a few cups of weak wine

05:52.050 --> 05:52.430
[Star] [Wind] [Sky]

05:52.360 --> 05:53.610
withstand

05:53.630 --> 05:55.550
the rushing evening wind?

05:54.640 --> 05:55.590
[Wind]

05:56.040 --> 05:57.440
The year is drawing to a close tonight,

05:57.440 --> 05:59.159
yet the wanderer is still miles from home.

05:59.159 --> 06:01.400
May snow still blankets
the Tianshan peaks,

06:01.400 --> 06:03.560
No flowers bloom,
only the biting cold speaks.

06:03.560 --> 06:05.640
If you resign now,

06:05.660 --> 06:07.380
I can let you choose how to die.

06:07.960 --> 06:09.890
You'd better save it for yourself.

06:16.920 --> 06:19.140
One flake, two flakes, three or four,

06:19.360 --> 06:21.400
five flakes, six flakes, seven or eight.

06:21.400 --> 06:23.960
Thousands, myriads, countless flakes,

06:23.960 --> 06:25.690
flying into the plum blossoms,

06:26.960 --> 06:28.720
vanishing from sight.

06:29.160 --> 06:31.060
What kind of doggerel is this?

06:31.280 --> 06:32.360
How can it count?

06:32.360 --> 06:33.800
This is an imperial poem written

06:33.800 --> 06:35.340
by His Majesty himself.

06:35.440 --> 06:36.600
How could it not count?

06:36.600 --> 06:37.159
Fine.

06:37.760 --> 06:38.840
I'll let it pass.

06:39.159 --> 06:42.120
You're just clinging to your last breath.

06:44.659 --> 06:47.040
A thousand fathoms of iron chains
sink to the riverbed,

06:47.040 --> 06:50.040
a banner of surrender rises
from Stone City overhead.

06:54.400 --> 06:55.520
Sure enough.

06:55.560 --> 06:56.760
How could these female prisoners

06:56.760 --> 06:58.850
outsmart voice-keeper?

06:58.880 --> 07:00.520
-The game is not set yet.
-That is right.

07:00.520 --> 07:03.360
It's still uncertain who will win.

07:04.200 --> 07:06.760
The seven-string zither plays a cold,
desolate sound,

07:06.760 --> 07:09.760
true understanding
of this art has rarely been found.

07:17.760 --> 07:19.170
My victory is certain.

07:19.500 --> 07:22.460
One more move and she loses.

07:29.450 --> 07:31.670
[Hai hour]

07:43.450 --> 07:45.450
We first met when we were young.

07:45.650 --> 07:47.060
You were fifteen.

07:47.680 --> 07:48.610
I was seventeen.

08:03.120 --> 08:04.580
Consider yourself lucky.

08:14.220 --> 08:15.220
Time's up.

08:15.240 --> 08:16.720
President Wan ran out of time!

08:16.720 --> 08:19.120
So Nan Yanzhi won?

08:19.230 --> 08:20.430
This round,

08:21.200 --> 08:22.650
you win.

08:22.960 --> 08:23.720
Ah!

08:23.750 --> 08:24.970
-We won!
-We won!

08:25.000 --> 08:26.090
We won!

08:26.170 --> 08:27.270
-We won!
-We won!

08:27.310 --> 08:28.670
We won!

08:32.100 --> 08:33.650
Weren't you supposed to die if you lost?

08:33.650 --> 08:34.179
Yeah.

08:34.400 --> 08:35.860
How can you just kill people randomly?

08:35.860 --> 08:36.929
The loser

08:37.360 --> 08:40.000
just needs to pick someone to die for her.

08:40.159 --> 08:43.120
As long as someone dies, it's fine.

08:45.640 --> 08:47.160
How could voice-keeper lose?

08:47.160 --> 08:49.750
Could the women
from Lingya Tower play dirty?

08:50.120 --> 08:51.850
Since ancient times,
gamblers must accept their losses.

08:51.850 --> 08:53.110
Are you going

08:53.140 --> 08:55.540
to renege on a promise with me,
a weak woman?

08:56.730 --> 08:57.530
Humph.

09:03.960 --> 09:05.160
Today,

09:05.160 --> 09:07.070
we've fought two consecutive rounds,

09:07.070 --> 09:08.530
with each side winning one.

09:08.530 --> 09:10.970
I'm sure everyone is exhausted.

09:11.360 --> 09:13.120
Let's call it a day.

09:13.400 --> 09:15.520
Go back and rest.

09:15.820 --> 09:17.420
We'll fight again tomorrow.

09:17.760 --> 09:19.230
The final result

09:19.480 --> 09:23.320
will be decided
by tomorrow's ritual archery.

09:23.600 --> 09:24.650
President Wan,

09:24.840 --> 09:27.000
what are the details of the third round?

09:27.000 --> 09:28.760
Please explain everything at once.

09:28.760 --> 09:29.360
That way,

09:30.400 --> 09:32.240
we can rest easy.

09:33.750 --> 09:35.990
You can rest assured.

09:36.160 --> 09:37.670
Tomorrow's third round

09:37.690 --> 09:40.200
will take place
in full view of the public,

09:40.230 --> 09:42.530
competing in ritual manners
and archery skills.

09:42.530 --> 09:43.440
How can these two

09:43.440 --> 09:44.640
be competed simultaneously?

09:44.640 --> 09:47.170
The Red and Blue Teams will
each choose four people.

09:47.170 --> 09:49.700
Two of them will be dressed
in full ceremonial attire

09:49.700 --> 09:52.030
to perform the ritual of bowing to Heaven.

09:52.390 --> 09:54.460
The other two stand on the opposite side

09:54.460 --> 09:55.890
holding feathered arrows,

09:55.890 --> 09:58.760
aiming at the jewels
adorning their teammates' hairpins.

09:58.760 --> 10:00.200
Shooting our own people?

10:00.220 --> 10:01.140
Exactly.

10:01.360 --> 10:02.840
The ritual performers

10:02.840 --> 10:04.610
will each hold a bowl of dew.

10:04.640 --> 10:06.510
When the arrow is shot,

10:06.530 --> 10:10.050
Any body movement
results in a one-point deduction.

10:10.200 --> 10:13.640
If dew spills from the bowl,
two points are deducted.

10:13.660 --> 10:15.740
If there are mistakes in the ritual,

10:15.770 --> 10:17.270
five points are deducted.

10:17.510 --> 10:19.060
If the jade bowl breaks,

10:20.380 --> 10:22.780
you'll lose the competition immediately.

10:23.280 --> 10:25.610
What if we accidentally
hit our teammate?

10:25.760 --> 10:28.290
Then you can only
consider yourself unlucky.

10:28.600 --> 10:31.520
But there are also bonus points
for shooting well.

10:31.980 --> 10:32.880
How?

10:33.040 --> 10:36.040
Each archer has three arrows.

10:36.160 --> 10:38.860
Hitting a jewelry
on the ritual performer's head

10:38.860 --> 10:40.130
adds five points.

10:40.200 --> 10:43.400
How do we decide who performs the ritual
and who holds the bow?

10:43.400 --> 10:44.330
By drawing lots.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.130
President Wan,

10:45.130 --> 10:46.370
I have a request.

10:46.520 --> 10:47.060
Speak.

10:47.120 --> 10:49.410
Since the rules are clear,

10:49.760 --> 10:51.640
I request President Wan

10:51.640 --> 10:53.050
to draw lots now.

10:53.360 --> 10:54.160
Alright.

10:54.570 --> 10:55.910
As you wish.

10:56.590 --> 10:57.790
Let's choose people.

11:00.500 --> 11:02.200
Just the four of you.

11:05.360 --> 11:06.760
We've made our choice.

11:06.760 --> 11:07.740
What about you?

11:12.440 --> 11:13.850
Since you guys know each other,

11:13.850 --> 11:15.580
you must have better teamwork.

11:15.960 --> 11:16.760
Yes, exactly.

11:17.160 --> 11:17.850
You guys go ahead.

11:17.850 --> 11:18.850
You guys go ahead.

11:19.050 --> 11:20.030
Count me in.

11:23.840 --> 11:24.640
Okay.

11:25.610 --> 11:27.410
Now we have exactly four people.

11:28.360 --> 11:29.240
Somebody!

11:35.750 --> 11:37.410
[Shoot]

11:37.660 --> 11:39.450
[Ritual]

11:38.960 --> 11:40.960
Now that the lots are drawn,

11:41.560 --> 11:44.460
everyone go back and prepare.

11:44.640 --> 11:46.130
See you tomorrow.

11:50.320 --> 11:52.120
I wonder what tricks Wan Hongliu

11:52.120 --> 11:54.000
will play tomorrow.

11:55.230 --> 11:56.960
I read the rules for the third round.

11:56.960 --> 11:59.480
Yanzhi has already made it clear
with President Wan.

11:59.480 --> 12:01.740
I suppose she won't play any more tricks.

12:02.760 --> 12:03.560
Hard to say.

12:03.760 --> 12:05.880
How could someone used to playing dirty

12:05.880 --> 12:07.520
suddenly become honest?

12:09.080 --> 12:10.010
What's going on?

12:10.040 --> 12:11.160
Is it Wan Hongliu?

12:12.960 --> 12:14.000
You stay here and protect them.

12:14.000 --> 12:15.460
I'll go out and take a look.

12:42.440 --> 12:43.590
Nan Yanzhi.

12:45.960 --> 12:46.880
Who are you?

12:47.560 --> 12:49.020
How do you know my name?

12:49.360 --> 12:51.240
I once bought your life
at the Lingya Tower casino.

12:51.240 --> 12:53.130
Of course I know who you are.

12:54.030 --> 12:54.890
Bought my life?

12:57.200 --> 12:59.400
So you are from the higher-ups.

12:59.760 --> 13:01.430
I wouldn't have thought
that a seemingly gentle

13:01.430 --> 13:03.560
young lady like you

13:03.580 --> 13:06.640
could also be a devil
who treats human lives like grass.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.720
But we have never met before.

13:09.220 --> 13:10.860
Never met before?

13:12.980 --> 13:14.350
If it weren't for you,

13:14.480 --> 13:16.450
my husband wouldn't have died.

13:18.000 --> 13:19.230
Your husband?

13:22.110 --> 13:24.440
You beheaded him
and abandoned his body in the wild.

13:24.440 --> 13:26.040
Have you forgotten all this?

13:29.240 --> 13:31.430
Only those on death row
would be brought to Lingya Tower.

13:31.430 --> 13:32.830
How did you sneak in here?

13:33.960 --> 13:34.920
The newly appointed top scholar

13:34.920 --> 13:36.260
was beheaded and dumped outside the city.

13:36.260 --> 13:37.960
The killer hasn't been caught yet.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.980
I went to the authorities
to turn myself in

13:39.980 --> 13:41.310
and took the blame.

13:41.420 --> 13:44.850
Your husband was the new top scholar,

13:44.880 --> 13:45.920
Shen Nian'an?

13:46.010 --> 13:47.150
You remember now?

13:48.970 --> 13:50.060
I didn't kill him.

13:50.920 --> 13:52.880
I only took the blame for the killer

13:52.880 --> 13:54.940
so that I could get into Lingya Tower.

13:55.290 --> 13:57.070
Do you think I would believe you?

13:57.070 --> 13:58.850
Everyone avoids Lingya Tower
like the plague.

13:58.850 --> 14:01.650
You would confess to a capital crime
just to get in?

14:08.760 --> 14:09.720
Sometimes,

14:10.360 --> 14:12.020
the more dangerous the place,

14:13.120 --> 14:14.260
the deeper the truth is hidden.

14:14.260 --> 14:16.080
I don't believe your nonsense.

14:16.360 --> 14:16.960
Today,

14:17.080 --> 14:18.360
I will avenge my husband

14:18.360 --> 14:19.920
with my own hands!

14:20.040 --> 14:21.120
Wait.

14:22.350 --> 14:23.970
I've seen his body.

14:23.990 --> 14:25.720
He was killed with a single strike.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.560
The wound on his neck is clean,

14:27.560 --> 14:29.240
caused by a sharp, heavy weapon.

14:29.240 --> 14:31.450
How could a woman like me

14:31.470 --> 14:32.810
manage that?

14:33.760 --> 14:34.560
Moreover,

14:34.990 --> 14:36.190
before he died,

14:36.600 --> 14:39.160
the tendons in his wrists and ankles
were severed.

14:39.160 --> 14:40.360
This wasn't merely murder.

14:40.360 --> 14:41.760
It was an act of vengeance.

14:41.760 --> 14:43.220
Think about it carefully.

14:43.440 --> 14:44.500
Who could possibly

14:45.120 --> 14:46.560
hate him that much?

14:47.290 --> 14:48.080
So much

14:48.890 --> 14:50.810
that they wanted to make him
unable to even beg for death?
